  "selection_guidance": [
    "Use 'Consol GL Group' for consolidated group-level reporting; use 'Consol GL Company' for single-entity analysis.",
    "Always filter by Scenario, Year, and Month; default to ACT, current_year, and current_month from system parameters.",
    "For elimination analysis prefer 'Consol GL Elimination Reconciliation' or 'Consol GL Group Entry' with Elim data source.",
    "Use Period Type 'Current' for monthly amounts and 'YTD' for year-to-date totals.",
    "When querying FX rates, always specify Currency From, Currency To, and FX Rate Type dimensions.",
    "For forecast vs budget comparisons use SLIM Forecast PnL and SLIM Budget PnL Staging with matching Scenario filters.",
    "Ownership and consolidation method questions should use Consol Definition Group cube.",
    "Reconciliation and data quality questions should use Consol Reconciliation Check Group or Company cubes.",
    "For financial statement questions, use finance_semantics to choose the matched cube and put the mapped line_item_dimension on ROWS."
